instead of this

      sdunif <- "expression:
      logdens=-log_precision/2;
      return(logdens)"

you can use

hyper=list(prec=list(prior="pc.prec",
			param=c(A,0.01))))

with A=1, or larger

On Wed, 2025-01-15 at 00:09 -0800, Insang Song wrote:

